      <div data-lang-en>
        <p>These Terms govern your use of the Tied iOS application (“the App”). By using the App you also agree to Apple’s standard <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" rel="noopener">Licensed Application End User License Agreement</a>. If you do not agree, do not use the App.</p>

